---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import workspace from '../assets/about/workspace.jpg';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---
<Base title="About" description="About me and how to get in touch.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="lede">I'm {SITE.name}, an engineering student in Thailand. Mostly I'm into electronics: designing PCBs, writing firmware for microcontrollers, and taking apart how existing hardware works so I can build my own.</p>
    <p>Game controllers are where a lot of my projects started. They're a good excuse to touch everything at once: sensors, LEDs, USB, and parts you physically press. These days I'm branching out to other boards too, like ESP32 projects with displays and NFC readers.</p>
    <p>Outside of that, I go bouldering.</p>

    <figure class="photo">
      <Image src={workspace} alt="My workspace: a desk with a 3D printer, shelves of parts and a whiteboard." widths={[640, 1000, 1400]} sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px" />
      <figcaption>Where most of this gets built.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <h2>Tools I reach for</h2>
    <p class="muted">KiCad for PCBs · C with the Pico SDK and ESP-IDF · Python · Fusion 360 and 3D printing · Git</p>

    <h2>Right now</h2>
    <p>Building a capacitive touch controller, and getting better at PCB layout along the way.</p>

    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <p>I'm on Thailand time (UTC+7). The easiest way to reach me is below.</p>
    <div class="links">
      <a href={SITE.github}>GitHub ↗</a>
      {SITE.email && <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>Email</a>}
      {SITE.linkedin && <a href={SITE.linkedin}>LinkedIn ↗</a>}
      {SITE.resume && <a href={SITE.resume}>Résumé (PDF)</a>}
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
